    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the tips. the water helped a bit but the dizziness is coming back in waves. i really dont have time to go to a doctor right now because of work. do you think i can just take some ibuprofen or maybe some ginger tea to settle my stomach and help with the head feeling? i just want to push through the rest of the day.",
